20:  *      WHERE user_id = :uid AND balance >= :amt   -- rowcount 0 = insufficient funds
21:  *      UPDATE user_wallets SET balance = balance + :amt WHERE user_id = :uid
22:  *  - Workers additionally take a pessimistic (FOR UPDATE) lock on wallet rows,
23:  *    always in ascending user_id order, to prevent deadlocks when two payments
24:  *    move money in opposite directions between the same pair of users.
